{"format":"bench-library","formatVersion":1,"id":"shift-register","name":"Shift register (74HC595)","version":"1.0.0","author":"Bench Workshop","owner":"codeopen0-cpu","description":"The 74HC595 on a little board: eight more outputs from three pins. shiftOut() the bits on DS and SHCP, then pulse STCP to show them on Q0-Q7. Comes with a light-chaser example on eight LEDs.","category":"Electronics","needsApp":"0.3.0","code":"// 74HC595: on each rising edge of SHCP the bits move up one (Q0 <- DS, Q7S <- the old bit 7); on a\r\n// rising edge of STCP the shifted bits are copied to the outputs. It listens to every pin change in\r\n// order (edges), so shiftOut() at full speed works.\r\nbench.device('hc595', (part) => {\r\n  let shift = 0, latch = 0, powered = false, v = 0, ds = 0, sh = 0, st = 0, mr = 1, bytes = 0;\r\n  const outs = ['Q0', 'Q1', 'Q2', 'Q3', 'Q4', 'Q5', 'Q6', 'Q7'];\r\n  return {\r\n    edges(list) {\r\n      for (const [pin, lv] of list) {\r\n        if (pin === 'DS') ds = lv;\r\n        else if (pin === 'MR') { mr = lv; if (!lv) shift = 0; }\r\n        else if (pin === 'SHCP') {\r\n          if (lv && !sh && mr) { shift = ((shift << 1) | ds) & 0xff; bytes++; }\r\n          sh = lv;\r\n        } else if (pin === 'STCP') {\r\n          if (lv && !st) latch = shift;\r\n          st = lv;\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    step(io) {\r\n      v = io.supply('VCC', 'GND');\r\n      powered = v >= 2;\r\n      // the levels now (in case a pin is held, not toggled: no edges came)\r\n      ds = io.level('DS') ?? ds;\r\n      mr = io.level('MR') ?? 1;\r\n      if (!mr) shift = 0;\r\n      sh = io.level('SHCP') ?? sh;\r\n      st = io.level('STCP') ?? st;\r\n      const enabled = powered && io.level('OE') !== 1;\r\n      outs.forEach((q, i) => (enabled ? io.drive(q, (latch >> i) & 1 ? v : 0, 1) : io.release(q)));\r\n      if (powered) io.drive('Q7S', (shift >> 7) & 1 ? v : 0, 1); else io.release('Q7S');\r\n      io.draw(powered ? 0.0001 : 0);\r\n    },\r\n    status() {\r\n      if (!powered) return ['no power'];\r\n      return [`Q7..Q0 = ${latch.toString(2).padStart(8, '0')}`, `${Math.floor(bytes / 8)} bytes shifted in`];\r\n    },\r\n  };\r\n});\r\n","parts":[{"id":"hc595","name":"Shift register (74HC595)","description":"DS (data), SHCP (shift clock), STCP (latch): shiftOut(DS, SHCP, MSBFIRST, value); then STCP HIGH and LOW: Q7..Q0 show the byte (Q0 = its lowest bit with MSBFIRST). OE LOW = outputs on (pulled low on the board), MR HIGH = not clearing (pulled high). VCC 2-6 V, each Q gives up to 20 mA. Q7S goes on to the DS of a second one.","swatch":"#2b2b2e","mass":2,"shape":[{"box":[3,0.16,2.4],"at":[0,0.08,0],"color":"#1d6b3a"},{"box":[2,0.3,0.75],"at":[0,0.31,0],"color":"#1a1a1c"},{"box":[0.12,0.02,0.12],"at":[-0.9,0.465,-0.25],"color":"#c9cdd4","collide":false}],"pinRows":[{"ids":["Q0","Q1","Q2","Q3","Q4","Q5","Q6","Q7"],"at":[-0.889,0,1],"kinds":{"Q0":"out","Q1":"out","Q2":"out","Q3":"out","Q4":"out","Q5":"out","Q6":"out","Q7":"out"}},{"ids":["VCC","GND","DS","SHCP","STCP","OE","MR","Q7S"],"at":[-0.889,0,-1],"kinds":{"VCC":"vin","GND":"gnd","DS":"in","SHCP":"in","STCP":"in","OE":"in","MR":"in","Q7S":"out"},"extra":{"VCC":{"label":"VCC (2-6 V)","vmin":2,"vmax":6},"DS":{"label":"DS (data in)"},"SHCP":{"label":"SHCP (shift clock)"},"STCP":{"label":"STCP (latch)"},"OE":{"label":"OE (LOW = outputs on)","pulled":"down"},"MR":{"label":"MR (LOW = clear)","pulled":"up"},"Q7S":{"label":"Q7S (to the next DS)"}}}],"device":"hc595"}],"examples":[{"name":"Light chaser","description":"Eight LEDs on one 74HC595, driven by three pins: a light runs back and forth. Press Run; add the Pin graph for DS, SHCP and STCP to see the bits go out.","project":{"format":"bench-workshop","version":1,"name":"Light chaser","parts":[{"uid":"board","type":"maker-board","name":"Board","params":{"usb":true},"parent":null,"pos":[-12,0,-2],"rot":[0,0,0,1]},{"uid":"sr","type":"shift-register/hc595","name":"74HC595","params":{},"parent":null,"pos":[2,0,-4],"rot":[0,0,0,1]},{"uid":"led0","type":"led","name":"LED 0","params":{"color":"red"},"parent":null,"pos":[-2.6,0,5],"rot":[0,0,0,1]},{"uid":"led1","type":"led","name":"LED 1","params":{"color":"red"},"parent":null,"pos":[-1.3,0,5],"rot":[0,0,0,1]},{"uid":"led2","type":"led","name":"LED 2","params":{"color":"yellow"},"parent":null,"pos":[0,0,5],"rot":[0,0,0,1]},{"uid":"led3","type":"led","name":"LED 3","params":{"color":"yellow"},"parent":null,"pos":[1.3000000000000003,0,5],"rot":[0,0,0,1]},{"uid":"led4","type":"led","name":"LED 4","params":{"color":"green"},"parent":null,"pos":[2.6,0,5],"rot":[0,0,0,1]},{"uid":"led5","type":"led","name":"LED 5","params":{"color":"green"},"parent":null,"pos":[3.9,0,5],"rot":[0,0,0,1]},{"uid":"led6","type":"led","name":"LED 6","params":{"color":"blue"},"parent":null,"pos":[5.200000000000001,0,5],"rot":[0,0,0,1]},{"uid":"led7","type":"led","name":"LED 7","params":{"color":"blue"},"parent":null,"pos":[6.5,0,5],"rot":[0,0,0,1]}],"wires":[{"id":"w1","a":{"uid":"board","pin":"3V3"},"b":{"uid":"sr","pin":"VCC"},"color":"#e04848"},{"id":"w2","a":{"uid":"board","pin":"GND"},"b":{"uid":"sr","pin":"GND"},"color":"#2b2d33"},{"id":"w3","a":{"uid":"board","pin":"GP2"},"b":{"uid":"sr","pin":"DS"},"color":"#e8c547"},{"id":"w4","a":{"uid":"board","pin":"GP3"},"b":{"uid":"sr","pin":"SHCP"},"color":"#4a90e2"},{"id":"w5","a":{"uid":"board","pin":"GP4"},"b":{"uid":"sr","pin":"STCP"},"color":"#3cb371"},{"id":"w6","a":{"uid":"sr","pin":"Q0"},"b":{"uid":"led0","pin":"A"},"color":"#e8c547"},{"id":"w7","a":{"uid":"led0","pin":"K"},"b":{"uid":"board","pin":"GND2"},"color":"#2b2d33"},{"id":"w8","a":{"uid":"sr","pin":"Q1"},"b":{"uid":"led1","pin":"A"},"color":"#e8c547"},{"id":"w9","a":{"uid":"led1","pin":"K"},"b":{"uid":"led0","pin":"K"},"color":"#2b2d33"},{"id":"w10","a":{"uid":"sr","pin":"Q2"},"b":{"uid":"led2","pin":"A"},"color":"#e8c547"},{"id":"w11","a":{"uid":"led2","pin":"K"},"b":{"uid":"led1","pin":"K"},"color":"#2b2d33"},{"id":"w12","a":{"uid":"sr","pin":"Q3"},"b":{"uid":"led3","pin":"A"},"color":"#e8c547"},{"id":"w13","a":{"uid":"led3","pin":"K"},"b":{"uid":"led2","pin":"K"},"color":"#2b2d33"},{"id":"w14","a":{"uid":"sr","pin":"Q4"},"b":{"uid":"led4","pin":"A"},"color":"#e8c547"},{"id":"w15","a":{"uid":"led4","pin":"K"},"b":{"uid":"led3","pin":"K"},"color":"#2b2d33"},{"id":"w16","a":{"uid":"sr","pin":"Q5"},"b":{"uid":"led5","pin":"A"},"color":"#e8c547"},{"id":"w17","a":{"uid":"led5","pin":"K"},"b":{"uid":"led4","pin":"K"},"color":"#2b2d33"},{"id":"w18","a":{"uid":"sr","pin":"Q6"},"b":{"uid":"led6","pin":"A"},"color":"#e8c547"},{"id":"w19","a":{"uid":"led6","pin":"K"},"b":{"uid":"led5","pin":"K"},"color":"#2b2d33"},{"id":"w20","a":{"uid":"sr","pin":"Q7"},"b":{"uid":"led7","pin":"A"},"color":"#e8c547"},{"id":"w21","a":{"uid":"led7","pin":"K"},"b":{"uid":"led6","pin":"K"},"color":"#2b2d33"}],"programs":{"board":{"lang":"arduino","source":"// Light chaser: eight LEDs on a 74HC595, from three pins. One light runs back and forth.\n#define DATA 2    // DS\n#define CLOCK 3   // SHCP\n#define LATCH 4   // STCP\n\nvoid show(byte pattern) {\n  digitalWrite(LATCH, LOW);\n  shiftOut(DATA, CLOCK, MSBFIRST, pattern);\n  digitalWrite(LATCH, HIGH);   // the outputs change now, all at once\n}\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(DATA, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(CLOCK, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(LATCH, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  for (int i = 0; i < 8; i++) { show(1 << i); delay(80); }\n  for (int i = 6; i > 0; i--) { show(1 << i); delay(80); }\n}\n"}},"boards":[]}}]}